# The development suite -- e2e tests, dev runner, verification stack -- is a
# private repository overlaid at this path: github.com/lemmary/lemmary-dev
#
# Leading slash on purpose: a bare "dev/" has no separator except the trailing
# one, so git would match a directory named dev at any depth.
/dev/
